  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Middle East Humanitarian Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DEC launched an appeal on 17th October to raise urgent funds to address critical humanitarian needs in the Middle East. The Appeal is a 2-year response. The dates for Phase 1 and Phase 2 are as follows:
&#x2022; Phase 1 is fixed at 6 months: 17 October 2024 - 30 April 2025, however, costs can be back
dated to 17 September 2024 (1 month prior to DEC appeal launch)
&#x2022; Phase 2 duration is 18 months: 01 May 2025 - 31 October 2026.

Each DEC member is required to spend 75% of their DEC funding on Gaza programming while the remainder of the allocation can be spent in other locations eligible (West Bank, Lebanon, Syria).</narrative>
  </description>
